# The notebooks carry committed outputs (figures as base64), so by byte count
# they dwarf the source. Without this, GitHub's language bar reports the repo
# as ~95% "Jupyter Notebook" and hides the fact that the substance is Python.
# Marking them as documentation keeps them browsable but out of the stats.
experiments/*.ipynb linguist-documentation

# Results are generated artefacts, not authored code.
results/* linguist-generated
